{
  "version": 1,
  "id": "mall",
  "name": "Mall",
  "intro": [
    "The mall. Warm, dry and recording everything I look at."
  ],
  "uses": [
    {
      "id": "implants",
      "name": "VANTA CLERK",
      "label": "[E] VANTA IMPLANTS",
      "purchase": "mall.implant",
      "routes": [
        {
          "when": {
            "state": "mall.implantAsked",
            "is": false
          },
          "command": "mall.implantAsked.intro",
          "pages": [
            "Welcome to Vanta. Eyes, ears, spines: the full catalogue.",
            "An optic upgrade starts at four hundred tokens. Thirty-six months' finance. Your lungs secure the loan."
          ]
        },
        {
          "when": {
            "flag": "mall:implant",
            "is": true
          },
          "pages": [
            "The light in your thumb? It's working. You just don't have any messages.",
            "We sell a messages package, if you'd like some."
          ]
        },
        {
          "when": {
            "tokensAtLeast": 2
          },
          "command": "mall.implant.buy",
          "pages": [
            "Excellent. A subdermal light, left thumb, two tokens. It glows when you get a message.",
            "(A pinch. A glow.) You don't get messages? It glows anyway. Optimism is a feature."
          ]
        },
        {
          "pages": [
            "We do have a budget option: looking at the catalogue. That's free.",
            "Until it isn't. Read the terms."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "kiosk",
      "name": "REGISTRY KIOSK",
      "label": "[E] VERIFY IDENTITY",
      "speakerKind": "device",
      "routes": [
        {
          "when": {
            "state": "mall.kioskAsked",
            "is": false
          },
          "command": "mall.kiosk.first",
          "pages": [
            "PLEASE LOOK INTO THE CAMERA.",
            "IDENTITY NOT FOUND. MEMBER PRICES UNAVAILABLE. PLEASE CONTACT YOUR REGISTRY OFFICE."
          ]
        },
        {
          "command": "mall.kiosk.again",
          "pages": [
            "IDENTITY NOT FOUND.",
            "THIS ATTEMPT HAS BEEN LOGGED. THANK YOU FOR SHOPPING AT THE GALLERIA."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pawn",
      "name": "PAWNBROKER",
      "label": "[E] PAWN \u00b7 SELL A MEMORY",
      "routes": [
        {
          "when": {
            "any": [
              {
                "all": [
                  {
                    "flag": "mall:pawn1",
                    "is": false
                  },
                  {
                    "flag": "mall:pawn2",
                    "is": false
                  },
                  {
                    "flag": "mall:pawn3",
                    "is": false
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "command": "mall.pawn.1",
          "pages": [
            "Memories bought by the megabyte. Let me see the head. Hold still.",
            "(The helmet hums.) Your first bike. Thirty-one megabytes, mostly a scuffed knee. One token.",
            "Pleasure. You won't miss it. Nobody remembers what they sold here, that's the beauty of it."
          ]
        },
        {
          "when": {
            "any": [
              {
                "all": [
                  {
                    "flag": "mall:pawn1",
                    "is": true
                  },
                  {
                    "flag": "mall:pawn2",
                    "is": false
                  },
                  {
                    "flag": "mall:pawn3",
                    "is": false
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "all": [
                  {
                    "flag": "mall:pawn1",
                    "is": false
                  },
                  {
                    "flag": "mall:pawn2",
                    "is": true
                  },
                  {
                    "flag": "mall:pawn3",
                    "is": false
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "all": [
                  {
                    "flag": "mall:pawn1",
                    "is": false
                  },
                  {
                    "flag": "mall:pawn2",
                    "is": false
                  },
                  {
                    "flag": "mall:pawn3",
                    "is": true
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "command": "mall.pawn.2",
          "pages": [
            "A birthday. Eleven candles. Good resolution, bit of cake on the lens.",
            "One token. I'd go two if there was a pony. There's never a pony."
          ]
        },
        {
          "when": {
            "any": [
              {
                "all": [
                  {
                    "flag": "mall:pawn1",
                    "is": true
                  },
                  {
                    "flag": "mall:pawn2",
                    "is": true
                  },
                  {
                    "flag": "mall:pawn3",
                    "is": false
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "all": [
                  {
                    "flag": "mall:pawn1",
                    "is": true
                  },
                  {
                    "flag": "mall:pawn2",
                    "is": false
                  },
                  {
                    "flag": "mall:pawn3",
                    "is": true
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "all": [
                  {
                    "flag": "mall:pawn1",
                    "is": false
                  },
                  {
                    "flag": "mall:pawn2",
                    "is": true
                  },
                  {
                    "flag": "mall:pawn3",
                    "is": true
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "command": "mall.pawn.3",
          "pages": [
            "A rainy afternoon reading on a bus. Low drama, low price.",
            "Still one token. I'm sentimental. Don't tell anyone, it's bad for business."
          ]
        },
        {
          "pages": [
            "No. You're running low. I don't buy from anyone under a gigabyte: bad for business, worse for you.",
            "Come back when you've made some new ones. Live a little. Then sell it to me."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "deck",
      "name": "DECK REPAIR",
      "label": "[E] DECK CHECKUP",
      "purchase": "mall.deck",
      "routes": [
        {
          "when": {
            "not": {
              "tokensAtLeast": 1
            }
          },
          "pages": [
            "A checkup is one token. I can look at it for free, but then all I'll tell you is that it's a deck."
          ]
        },
        {
          "when": {
            "state": "mall.deckChecked",
            "is": false
          },
          "command": "mall.deck.first",
          "pages": [
            "(She opens your deck, blows into it, closes it.) Dust in the fan. Fixed.",
            "Three sets of fingerprints on the keys. Yours, a cat's, and someone who types fast and angry. A friend?"
          ]
        },
        {
          "command": "mall.deck.again",
          "pages": [
            "It's clean. Stop paying me to tell you it's clean.",
            "...Fine. Token received. It's clean."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "florist",
      "name": "FLORIST",
      "label": "[E] FLORIST",
      "purchase": "mall.leaf",
      "routes": [
        {
          "when": {
            "state": "mall.floristAsked",
            "is": false
          },
          "command": "mall.floristAsked.intro",
          "pages": [
            "Everything here is real. Grown in dirt, in daylight, from a seed. Look, don't touch.",
            "The fern is nine hundred tokens. The basil is four hundred. A single basil leaf is two."
          ]
        },
        {
          "when": {
            "not": {
              "tokensAtLeast": 2
            }
          },
          "pages": [
            "Then just breathe near the fern. The first breath is free."
          ]
        },
        {
          "when": {
            "state": "mall.leafBought",
            "is": false
          },
          "command": "mall.leaf.first",
          "pages": [
            "One leaf. I'll wrap it.",
            "Smell it on the way home. That's what you're paying for. Eating it would be a waste of money."
          ]
        },
        {
          "command": "mall.leaf.again",
          "pages": [
            "Another leaf. You remind me of someone: the one with the deck and the smart pot.",
            "Buys plant food here. Talks to their fern. The fern looks well on it."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "keys",
      "name": "KEY CUTTER",
      "label": "[E] KEY CUTTER",
      "purchase": "mall.blankchip",
      "routes": [
        {
          "when": {
            "state": "mall.keyAsked",
            "is": false
          },
          "command": "mall.keys.intro",
          "pages": [
            "Keys cut. Chips copied. Registered chips only, it says so on the counter.",
            "Unregistered ones I don't copy. I clone. Different word, different price.",
            "Bring me a chip and a reason. I copy the chip and forget the reason."
          ]
        },
        {
          "when": {
            "flag": "mall:blankchip",
            "is": true
          },
          "command": "mall.keys.owned",
          "pages": [
            "You have your blank. When you need something opened, bring the chip it's afraid of."
          ]
        },
        {
          "when": {
            "tokensAtLeast": 2
          },
          "command": "mall.keys.buy",
          "pages": [
            "A blank chip. Unregistered. Not illegal, just unsold.",
            "I'll remember your face. It's the one memory I never sell."
          ]
        },
        {
          "command": "mall.keys.refuse",
          "pages": [
            "Two tokens for a blank. The pawnshop pays for memories, if you're short. I don't ask which ones."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "order",
      "name": "FOOD COURT",
      "label": "[E] ORDER",
      "purchase": "mall.meal",
      "routes": [
        {
          "when": {
            "not": {
              "tokensAtLeast": 1
            }
          },
          "pages": [
            "One token. We take tokens, registered cards and nothing else. You are nothing else."
          ]
        },
        {
          "when": {
            "state": "mall.meal",
            "is": 0
          },
          "command": "mall.meal.0",
          "pages": [
            "Noodles, number four. The number is the noodles. There is no one to three."
          ]
        },
        {
          "when": {
            "state": "mall.meal",
            "is": 1
          },
          "command": "mall.meal.1",
          "pages": [
            "Vat burger. Grown in a vat in the basement. The vat has a name. We don't say it in front of customers."
          ]
        },
        {
          "command": "mall.meal.2",
          "pages": [
            "Dumplings. Six. Count them. I counted them. We both know it's five."
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "people": [
    {
      "id": "teen",
      "name": "KIOSK",
      "talk": [
        [
          "Phone cases. Screens. Screen protectors for your screen protector.",
          "I get paid by the hour. The hours are very long. Coincidence."
        ],
        [
          "If you're not buying, could you at least look interested? Camera 6 counts customers."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "kid",
      "name": "KID",
      "talk": [
        [
          "I threw a token in. I wished for two tokens.",
          "The fountain is thinking about it."
        ],
        [
          "Mum says the fountain money goes to the Registry. I said then the Registry has my wish.",
          "She said that's what worries her."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "diner",
      "name": "DINER",
      "talk": [
        [
          "Six counters in this food court. Four of them are the same kitchen.",
          "I eat lunch here because the park charges by the minute."
        ],
        [
          "Try the noodles. Everything else is also the noodles, in a different shape."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "security",
      "name": "SECURITY",
      "talk": [
        [
          "Galleria security. You look unverified. Most people do, after nine.",
          "I'm not paid to chase you. I'm paid to write down which way you went."
        ],
        [
          "Lost child? Desk 2. Lost identity? Also desk 2. It's a busy desk."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dancer",
      "name": "SECURITY",
      "talk": [
        [
          "(He freezes, mid-move.)",
          "Camera 14 has a blind spot behind this pillar. Four minutes an hour. I did not tell you that.",
          "I'm stretching. It's in the union agreement."
        ],
        [
          "You again. Either dance or stand guard. Those are the only two jobs in here."
        ]
      ]
    }
  ],
  "readables": [
    {
      "id": "kiosk",
      "name": "DIRECTORY",
      "pages": [
        "GALLERIA \u00b7 GROUND FLOOR: IMPLANTS \u00b7 PAWN \u00b7 DECK REPAIR \u00b7 FLORIST \u00b7 KEYS \u00b7 FOOD COURT.",
        "EXITS: METRO (WEST). SKY TAXI (ROOF). SERVICE CORRIDOR (EAST, STAFF ONLY)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "fountain",
      "name": "FOUNTAIN",
      "pages": [
        "COINS ARE COLLECTED NIGHTLY. PROCEEDS: GALLERIA MAINTENANCE FUND.",
        "WISHES ARE NOT RECORDED."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "escalator",
      "name": "ESCALATOR B",
      "pages": [
        "ESCALATOR B \u00b7 UP ONLY.",
        "DOWN SERVICE SUSPENDED PENDING REVIEW. USE STAIRS C."
      ]
    }
  ],
